  <item>
    <title>E24 人家三十而立，我连三十秒都立不住</title>
    <link>https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/6ac4dae3e742e36efcbeeee4</link>
    <guid isPermaLink="false">6ac4dae3e742e36efcbeeee4</guid>
    <pubDate>Tue, 06 Oct 2026 11:29:56 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<p><span>来到所谓「三十而立」的年纪，却老觉得自己连三十秒都立不住。站在这个特殊的节点，我对生命依旧有非常多的困惑和不解。但相比以前刷朋友圈时会因为自我厌恶而生理性反胃的二十多岁，现在的我更加明确自己是谁，我在做什么，谁对我重要，因此那些对外界评价和展示的焦虑和紧张轻轻脱落了。这期播客是我在杭州的新家第一次录制的单口，跟你分享一些中女时代的体会。</span></p><p></p><p><span>⌛️时间戳</span></p><p></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="45">0:45</a>&nbsp;重大update：我换工作到杭州啦</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="182">03:02</a>&nbsp;跳槽感悟：永远不要放弃公开表达</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="486">08:06</a>&nbsp;坚持健身的秘诀是让开启成本足够低</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="618">10:18</a>&nbsp;不再发朋友圈庆祝生日的背后</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="904">15:04</a>&nbsp;打好迎接名利的心理生理基础</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1134">18:54</a>&nbsp;人生本身苦难重重，放弃幻想，面对现实</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1247">20:47</a>&nbsp;生活本身就是最好的道场</span></p><p></p><p><span>🎵音乐</span></p><p><span>亲爱的你啊 — 任素汐</span></p>]]></description>
    <enclosure url="https://media.xyzcdn.net/65e2b36447367b94d9d75533/lgHfdkyD1Tiiqa82bBl00plLjHUf.m4a" length="21868949" type="audio/mp4"/>
    <itunes:duration>00:22:32</itunes:duration>
    <itunes:image href="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FgeraYgYYyw9e8zN3cqg78-yf29o.jpg"/>
    <itunes:explicit>false</itunes:explicit>
  </item>
  <item>
    <title>E23 不可承受的金钱之重</title>
    <link>https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/6a4103609d2f5743683f1bc1</link>
    <guid isPermaLink="false">6a4103609d2f5743683f1bc1</guid>
    <pubDate>Sun, 28 Jun 2026 11:22:20 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<p><span>怎样才能变有钱？有钱是为了什么？钱应该花在哪里？怎样才能过上幸福美满的人生？如何面对嫉妒和贪婪？这些问题都在摩根侯塞尔的两本书里得到解答。本期节目我会分享《金钱心理学》《金钱的艺术》这两本书，希望可以给你带来一些新知和思考。</span></p><p></p><p><span>💰🧠《金钱心理学》</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="288">04:48</a>&nbsp;No&nbsp;one&nbsp;is&nbsp;crazy</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="609">10:09</a>&nbsp;比尔盖茨的百万分之一</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="833">13:53</a>&nbsp;Happiness&nbsp;is&nbsp;not&nbsp;wanting</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1048">17:28</a>&nbsp;尾部效应，保持在场</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1204">20:04</a>&nbsp;豪车悖论也许并不适用于的领域</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1386">23:06</a>&nbsp;储蓄是把本可被他人左右的未来拿回到自己手中</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1576">26:16</a>&nbsp;Everything&nbsp;has&nbsp;a&nbsp;price ；是&nbsp;fee&nbsp;不是&nbsp;fine</span></p><p></p><p><span>💰🎨《金钱的艺术》</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1704">28:24</a>&nbsp;荣格：人生幸福五要素</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1859">30:59</a>&nbsp;钱应该花在哪里</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2097">34:57</a>&nbsp;多巴胺的陷阱</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2214">36:54</a>&nbsp;内在标尺和外在标尺</span></p><p></p><p><span>🎵音乐</span></p><p><span>Money Honey — Lady Gaga</span></p>]]></description>
    <enclosure url="https://media.xyzcdn.net/65e2b36447367b94d9d75533/lrEE9Q0-kYPBala4X4DjnpuhsZZz.m4a" length="42304368" type="audio/mp4"/>
    <itunes:duration>00:43:35</itunes:duration>
    <itunes:image href="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FgeraYgYYyw9e8zN3cqg78-yf29o.jpg"/>
    <itunes:explicit>false</itunes:explicit>
