  <item>
    <title>E15 我们终会找到自己的报应</title>
    <link>https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/67e8163c6ea60022359a5a6d</link>
    <guid isPermaLink="false">67e8163c6ea60022359a5a6d</guid>
    <pubDate>Sat, 29 Mar 2025 15:59:59 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<p><span>嘉宾返场👏跟心理治疗师阿 P 聊了两个半小时的「报应」，全程无剪辑，是一场非常流动的对话，欢迎收听～</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="122">02:02</a> 盼盼在 dating app上遇到的帅气男嘉宾竟然是杀猪盘？！</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="884">14:44</a> 针对女性的杀猪盘：高富帅，坚硬的外壳，脆弱的内心；针对男性的杀猪盘：大哥带你见见世面</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="952">15:52</a> 跟「雇佣兵杀手」的网恋故事</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1125">18:45</a> 我们终究会活成我们应该活成的样子</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1282">21:22</a> 面对爱情，我们也许在故意犯傻</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1381">23:01</a> 浪漫爱的破碎会带来不甘心和悲哀吗？</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1662">27:42</a> 婚礼上的童话故事结束以后，真实的生活开始了</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2691">44:51</a> 「三岁看小，七岁看老」这句话好像是真的？如何从精神分析的角度解释</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3360">56:00</a> 双相发作的时候为什么会对迸发飞蛾扑火般的爱情</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3486">58:06</a> 蔡康永说，这是文艺青年的宿命</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3636">01:00:36</a> 双相让我完全共情了梵高，康复让我不再理解他</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3879">01:04:39</a> 能够犯傻也是一种幸福</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="4521">01:15:21</a> 回看十年前父母在我高考的时候写给我的信，我感受到了生命的轮回</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="4615">01:16:55</a> 「父母一定会爱自己孩子」是最大的谎言</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="4876">01:21:16</a> 社会极端事件造成的集体创伤如何影响到个体的精神健康</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="5475">01:31:15</a> 弟弟告诉我「我其实没有很喜欢你」，我坦然接受，因为我也没有很喜欢他（虽然我们很相爱）</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="5948">01:39:08</a> 我们像「红楼梦」一样在一开始就拿到了自己人生的判词</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="6112">01:41:52</a> 用DeepSeek算生命数字，被准确度震惊</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="6252">01:44:12</a> 更适合中国宝宝的心理咨询：算命</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="6421">01:47:01</a> 常识失效的地方就是精神分析开始起作用的地方</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="6508">01:48:28</a> 基于微信三件套的 MBTI 聚类分析（该发论文了）</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="7160">01:59:20</a> Sherlock里对人细致入微的观察分析</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="7329">02:02:09</a> 为什么很多伟大的艺术家作家都有双相</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="7581">02:06:21</a> 精神疾病也许不是病，而是人类广阔的谱系</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="7815">02:10:15</a> 我不再给朋友建议，因为那不是ta生活的经验</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="7944">02:12:24</a> 你会不会怕孤独终老</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="8238">02:17:18</a> 经过计算，往后我最多能见爷爷 40 次</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="8579">02:22:59</a> 朋克老奶：我每天都在想，我怎么还没死呢？</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="8733">02:25:33</a> 在因果循环的锁链中我们究竟能做什么</span></p><span></span><p><span>🎵音乐</span></p><span></span><p><span>如愿 -- 王菲</span></p>]]></description>
    <enclosure url="https://media.xyzcdn.net/65e2b36447367b94d9d75533/ltdpxEYm3Q9x-3z5jeMI40kShIvM.m4a" length="146090859" type="audio/mp4"/>
    <itunes:duration>02:30:33</itunes:duration>
    <itunes:image href="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FgeraYgYYyw9e8zN3cqg78-yf29o.jpg"/>
    <itunes:explicit>false</itunes:explicit>
  </item>
